        "voice": {
          "lockedIntro": {
            "news": "I'm Bobby G, and this is Because the Light was on. I'm told this is the news. A recent study shows that people who watch news programs are 40% more likely to be aware that a news program is currently happening. ... [Pause] ... Here are some things that occurred while we weren't looking.",
